    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/f85714fac1e98df797d0852cb1750c06.avif?t=1754066267\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join our Discord ! The best place to report a bug and join the community.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Next Patch features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fix bugs with UI menus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Implement Ray Tracing to improve Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various minor bugs that have been reported by players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Future RoadMap Goals</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphical Improvements to the various environments and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Performance Improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding more missions bringing the total number of unique missions to over 40!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding new enemy types such as flying drones that can attack the player from the air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding teammate AI that will allow players who play singleplayer to control a squad of AI controlled police.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more to come !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What has already been updated ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Bridge Mission in Valermo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Singleplayer can now heal with large health syringe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Added new flying drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rework of all of the police commander voices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Helicopter now shoot rockets at the player, making them even more deadly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improved the dog, civilians and enemies AI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Technical</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Added HLOD models for large complex buildings. This should improve performance in certain areas of the maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rework footstep sounds and improved the footstep spatialization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Performance on moving trains, inside places</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more in the patch notes!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/dcbee4e1be813948ba3e2aa300d9ce15.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>From Gooseman, the legendary creator of the original Counter-Strike mod, comes Alpha Response - an adrenaline-fueled singleplayer/co-op experience that puts you in the boots of elite police forces worldwide.<br>Respond to critical situations requiring surgical precision to save innocent lives. Every decision matters in a world where threats lurk around every corner. Bring justice to chaos!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/c9ce9f497b1ac2ff524d9fa0f9c91ff4.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Join a global police initiative battling cross-border criminal syndicates. Choose your elite unit and take the fight to the enemy.<br>Team up with 3 friends in explosive 4-player co-op or take on the challenge solo. Coordination is key - your survival depends on it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/93f023f30a0ee25c75ea178a43ea0dba.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/93f023f30a0ee25c75ea178a43ea0dba.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/28b44f7f630feb53ea18a1eee5dece54.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Alpha Response features heart-racing dynamic missions from hostage rescues to bomb threats with multiple tactical approaches. Enemies spawn differently each time - no two operations are ever the same. Adapt or die, no two missions are ever the same<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e6214aed00a8dd1a13521819ccd6f33c.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e6214aed00a8dd1a13521819ccd6f33c.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e6214aed00a8dd1a13521819ccd6f33c.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e699209a41f9ff786b40a5baab32de6b.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Fight across massive, detailed environments from city streets and massive metro stations to towering cathedrals and industrial complexes. Navigate indoor and outdoor battlegrounds teeming with civilians who need your protection.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ffbcaeab3f68402d61ab18548cbe4088.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ffbcaeab3f68402d61ab18548cbe4088.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ffbcaeab3f68402d61ab18548cbe4088.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/b1486fa48c641bb954cef5d3ed0df46e.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Face a lethal variety of opponents - hardened criminals, attack dogs, armored vehicles, and helicopter gunships. Each threat demands unique tactics to overcome.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/7e904378fa43c37fe8c36de18c24bce8.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/7e904378fa43c37fe8c36de18c24bce8.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/7e904378fa43c37fe8c36de18c24bce8.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/a8fd3e1ce122a4f1600be3859b017c82.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Dominate with an extensive arsenal from sidearms to heavy weaponry. Deploy shields, grenades, and vehicles to gain the tactical edge. Every tool is essential for mission success.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ae6f9f2bfdd9264ea52078559133547c.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ae6f9f2bfdd9264ea52078559133547c.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ae6f9f2bfdd9264ea52078559133547c.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
