dapt or die, no two missions are ever the same<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e6214aed00a8dd1a13521819ccd6f33c.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e6214aed00a8dd1a13521819ccd6f33c.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e6214aed00a8dd1a13521819ccd6f33c.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/e699209a41f9ff786b40a5baab32de6b.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Fight across massive, detailed environments from city streets and massive metro stations to towering cathedrals and industrial complexes. Navigate indoor and outdoor battlegrounds teeming with civilians who need your protection.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ffbcaeab3f68402d61ab18548cbe4088.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ffbcaeab3f68402d61ab18548cbe4088.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ffbcaeab3f68402d61ab18548cbe4088.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/b1486fa48c641bb954cef5d3ed0df46e.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Face a lethal variety of opponents - hardened criminals, attack dogs, armored vehicles, and helicopter gunships. Each threat demands unique tactics to overcome.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/7e904378fa43c37fe8c36de18c24bce8.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/7e904378fa43c37fe8c36de18c24bce8.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/7e904378fa43c37fe8c36de18c24bce8.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/a8fd3e1ce122a4f1600be3859b017c82.avif?t=1754066267\" data-has-big /></div><br>Dominate with an extensive arsenal from sidearms to heavy weaponry. Deploy shields, grenades, and vehicles to gain the tactical edge. Every tool is essential for mission success.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ae6f9f2bfdd9264ea52078559133547c.poster.avif?t=1754066267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ae6f9f2bfdd9264ea52078559133547c.webm?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/ae6f9f2bfdd9264ea52078559133547c.mp4?t=1754066267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "From Gooseman, creator of the original Counter-Strike mod - Alpha Response delivers intense police action in dynamic, real-world environments. Fight solo or with friends against diverse enemies in high-stakes missions that demand fast reflexes, teamwork and split-second decision making.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cEvery moment is pure cinema. I\u2019m dodging between vehicles , popping around the side like John Wick to pop villains with a handgun. I can approach with a Baton and whip them into shape. Each run features different types of villainous organizations, and it\u2019s just a nice change of pace. Plus, bringing three additional friends along for the show, Alpha Response turns into a full-blown blockbuster affair. Bullets screaming across the screen, all while trying to revive one of our downed partners, is hectic in all the right ways.\u201d<br>Vice<br><br>\u201cAlpha Response Preview: A Powerful Vibe Gooseman returns with a promising teamplay-oriented FPS.\u201d<br>IGN France<br><br>\u201cIt's fast, it's fun, it's a sensory spectacle, and it's totally unique - it's better than any other shooter on Steam this year.\u201d<br>PCGamesN<br>",
